        <mxCell id="notes" value="One country at a time; two shared request slots initially. Recovery runs only where needed.&lt;br&gt;Scoring and pooling use code. Incomplete work stays visible; it never becomes a false zero." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=15;fontColor=#536c7c;" vertex="1" parent="1">
