        <mxCell id="notes" value="MODEL ALLOWLIST: prompt + enabled vocabulary + strict schema + authorized source / record units only.&lt;br&gt;No team guides, archives, previous scores, unrelated files or arbitrary folder scans enter model context.&lt;br&gt;One country / two shared request slots. Usage ledger + resume. Stale jobs cannot replace newer snapshots." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=15;fontColor=#536c7c;" vertex="1" parent="1">
